# fw_printenv and fw_setenv configuration
#
# This is the REAL U-Boot environment on this platform. U-Boot loads and
# saves it from the start of the uboot_env partition (/dev/sda11), and the
# Nerves A/B slot selection logic depends on it. Keep in sync with
# fwup_include/fwup-common.conf (UBOOT_ENV_OFFSET, byte 0x1_24AF_0000 on
# /dev/sda) and uboot/nerves.fragment (CONFIG_ENV_SCSI_HW_PARTITION="0:11",
# CONFIG_ENV_SIZE=0x20000).

# Device name	Device offset	Env. size	Flash sector size	Number of sectors
/dev/sda11	0x0		0x20000		0x1000			32
